{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killer Chat! Expanded Edition</strong> builds on our award-winning dark satirical serial killer dating chatsim Killer Chat! to make your time in the slaughterhouse bigger, better and bloodier than ever before with more routes, endings, art, and achievements! <strong>Kickstarter coming Spring 2025.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After asking too many murder-related questions online (for your book), you get an invite to a... serial killer chatroom?!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What the...?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SO YOU'RE A SERIAL KILLER. SUPPOSEDLY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reporter by day, an aspiring writer by night: you've been asking all the important questions on the dark web.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like, how do you bury a body?\u00a0How do you kill someone with a crowbar with the right angle to cause blunt-force trauma? What's the best way to hide from law enforcement?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're to write a good crime book, this is how you'll do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, <strong>ERROR! UNKNOWN\u00a0</strong>invites you to a server... with a warning.\u00a0&quot;don't be so obvious smh You're Gonna\u00a0Get\u00a0Caught&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a serial killer chatroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be slightly screwed.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO HELL, LOSERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a (fully customisable!) character as you\u2026\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperately pretend to be a serial killer\u2026 just like the other <span class=\"bb_strike\">girls</span> serial killers. So they don't kick you out. Or kill you. Oh god, they might kill you.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know some killers. You might as well scope this out, right? No better chance to gather accurate first-hand data for your book.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huh, they're actually kind of nice? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh shit, he's hot. And she's hot.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you can\u2026 date\u2026 some murderers?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What even is your life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yup, you heard us right!\u00a0<i>Killer Chat!</i> is a dark satire romance\u00a0chatsim\u00a0where you date serial killers. Pretend to be a serial killer, get inspiration for your book,\u00a0fall in love,\u00a0and try not to call the cops through a whirlwind six months with your murderous beau of choice.\u00a0 Who knows? You might find your happily ever after... or headline the news as a gruesomely lovesick\u00a0corpse. It's honestly up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURING WHO OTHER THAN... YOURS TRULY?</strong>\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/9c2099f20aa35b4ca47a86f0385ad540.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/9c2099f20aa35b4ca47a86f0385ad540.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=448 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customisable MC! (Name, username, personality,\u00a0gender, face, body,\u00a0clothing, accessories,\u00a0what kind of\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">pseudo</span>\u00a0serial killer you are...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">serial killers</span> love interests across all genders (male, female, non-binary)...\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich, choice-based branching towards 10+ new unique endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make voice\u00a0and video calls to\u00a0the server's serial killers, listen to voice messages, get them to accept your friend requests, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/b4490db0ee9d40d6d51149ac00593c82.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/b4490db0ee9d40d6d51149ac00593c82.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write your own status, biography, and messages in chat!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/07a1ff50fc15837b427d54e2f8945954.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/07a1ff50fc15837b427d54e2f8945954.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/a23379b92903f3a82a44b3f6d672eafd.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/a23379b92903f3a82a44b3f6d672eafd.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=520 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship routes to hang out with, y'know, your other serial killer friends when you're not busy falling in love.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless illustrated CG's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom-made OST,  sound effects, and a horrifying (or divine?) server bot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more!</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're planning on adding <u>many more features</u> exclusive to the Expanded Edition, so stay tuned for the full announcement. However,  how much content we can add\u00a0<strong>depends</strong> <strong>on how much we get funded</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNINGS:\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swearing, death, murder, references to abuse, and serial killers... but you knew that.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET THE SERIALS!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/b9557d8579b3e70d96fac151c62eafcb.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/b9557d8579b3e70d96fac151c62eafcb.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/f377daaa115f700f77aa3ebd4424a364.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/f377daaa115f700f77aa3ebd4424a364.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/3b72490e29f9761c212d833a2c352ae2.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/3b72490e29f9761c212d833a2c352ae2.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/460fed1ebcc376df346654238eacb863.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/460fed1ebcc376df346654238eacb863.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND THE REST...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(An arsonist, a slasher out of the '90's, a surfer who trips into killing,\u00a0a lonely hearts poisoner\u00a0... you'll have to play the game, won't'cha?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/8c9c50ef1c62ff3d20a0c7612e0420e4.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/8c9c50ef1c62ff3d20a0c7612e0420e4.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=533 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3378100?t=1760871836","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3378100?t=1760871836","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/c08fe060f4bc40833e05ab93878f90b00d7e844c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760871836","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/c08fe060f4bc40833e05ab93878f90b00d7e844c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760871836","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3509350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killer Chat! Expanded Edition</strong> builds on our award-winning dark satirical serial killer dating chatsim Killer Chat! to make your time in the slaughterhouse bigger, better and bloodier than ever before with more routes, endings, art, and achievements! <strong>Kickstarter coming Spring 2025.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After asking too many murder-related questions online (for your book), you get an invite to a... serial killer chatroom?!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What the...?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SO YOU'RE A SERIAL KIL