p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make voice\u00a0and video calls to\u00a0the server's serial killers, listen to voice messages, get them to accept your friend requests, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/b4490db0ee9d40d6d51149ac00593c82.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/b4490db0ee9d40d6d51149ac00593c82.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write your own status, biography, and messages in chat!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/07a1ff50fc15837b427d54e2f8945954.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/07a1ff50fc15837b427d54e2f8945954.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/a23379b92903f3a82a44b3f6d672eafd.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/a23379b92903f3a82a44b3f6d672eafd.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=520 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship routes to hang out with, y'know, your other serial killer friends when you're not busy falling in love.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless illustrated CG's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom-made OST,  sound effects, and a horrifying (or divine?) server bot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more!</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're planning on adding <u>many more features</u> exclusive to the Expanded Edition, so stay tuned for the full announcement. However,  how much content we can add\u00a0<strong>depends</strong> <strong>on how much we get funded</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNINGS:\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swearing, death, murder, references to abuse, and serial killers... but you knew that.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET THE SERIALS!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/b9557d8579b3e70d96fac151c62eafcb.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/b9557d8579b3e70d96fac151c62eafcb.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/f377daaa115f700f77aa3ebd4424a364.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/f377daaa115f700f77aa3ebd4424a364.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/3b72490e29f9761c212d833a2c352ae2.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/3b72490e29f9761c212d833a2c352ae2.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/460fed1ebcc376df346654238eacb863.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/460fed1ebcc376df346654238eacb863.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND THE REST...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(An arsonist, a slasher out of the '90's, a surfer who trips into killing,\u00a0a lonely hearts poisoner\u00a0... you'll have to play the game, won't'cha?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/8c9c50ef1c62ff3d20a0c7612e0420e4.avif?t=1760871836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/8c9c50ef1c62ff3d20a0c7612e0420e4.avif?t=1760871836 width=800 height=533 /></span></p>","developers":["rosesrot"],"dlc":[3896770,3866420,3901560],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/header.jpg?t=1760871836","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2026 by rosesrot and angelrot games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit Intel-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 300 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 10.10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1